  "solution": "Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>m</mi></semantics></math> là số tiền dự định trả hằng tháng.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> là số tiền gốc đã vay.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>i</mi></semantics></math> là lãi suất 1 tháng.<br>Theo dự định số tiền phải trả hàng tháng bằng\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>006</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>006</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>60</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>006</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>60</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>6</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>006</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>60</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>006</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>60</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tSố tiền còn nợ sau 12 tháng là<br><div><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo>